# The same graph while the game runs (ADR 0211): the state the layer is in
# lit, and then -- the game paused, Grounded and Rise set in Properties as a
# script would set them, and four ticks stepped -- Fall lit, Move fading out
# of it, the arrow between them just taken. `sleep` is the clock's: the
# character has to have landed, and frames are no measure of that; the steps
# are ticks, which is why the fade is where it is on any machine.
# Coordinates are a 1600 by 900 frame's.
wait 60
drag 700 607 700 820
wait 6
key ctrl+p
wait 8
text hero.animgraph
wait 10
key enter
wait 30
click 170 106
wait 4
text Animation
wait 12
click 172 177
wait 20
click 781 41
sleep 4000
click 490 76
wait 10
shot anim-running
# Pause; Grounded off; Rise typed; four steps.
click 781 41
wait 6
click 1417 596
wait 4
dbl 1498 618
wait 4
key ctrl+a
wait 2
text -5
wait 2
key enter
wait 6
click 819 41
wait 4
click 819 41
wait 4
click 819 41
wait 4
click 819 41
wait 4
shot anim-fading
quit
